#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:clothing_boutique.product_template_57
msgid ""
"These classic blue denim jeans are a versatile staple for any modern "
"wardrobe. Featuring a high-waisted fit and a straight-leg cut, they offer "
"both comfort and a timeless silhouette. The traditional five-pocket design "
"and durable metal button closure ensure practicality and long-lasting wear. "
"Crafted with subtle contrast stitching, these jeans provide a polished look "
"that pairs easily with any top. Available in multiple sizes, they are the "
"perfect choice for effortless everyday style."
msgstr ""

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:clothing_boutique.product_template_55
msgid ""
"These sophisticated tan trousers feature a classic tailored fit that is "
"perfect for elevating your professional wardrobe. Designed with elegant "
"front pleats and a high-waisted silhouette, they offer a timeless look that "
"is both flattering and comfortable. The crisp pressed creases and straight-"
"leg cut ensure a polished appearance for any formal or business-casual "
"occasion. Crafted for versatility, these trousers include functional belt "
"loops and a streamlined concealed closure for a clean finish. Pair them with"
" a blouse or blazer for a refined ensemble that transitions effortlessly "
"from the office to dinner."
msgstr ""

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:clothing_boutique.product_template_60
msgid ""
"This elegant long belted coat is a timeless addition to any wardrobe, "
"offering a sophisticated silhouette in a classic beige hue. Crafted with a "
"clean, tailored design, it provides both warmth and structure, making it "
"ideal for the cooler months. The adjustable waist belt allows you to cinch "
"the coat for a flattering fit or wear it open for a more relaxed look. "
"Featuring notched lapels and discreet side pockets, this piece seamlessly "
"combines functional details with refined style. Whether layered over office "
"attire or paired with casual weekend wear, this versatile coat ensures a "
"polished appearance for any occasion."
msgstr ""

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:clothing_boutique.product_template_56
msgid ""
"This elegant wrap dress is a timeless wardrobe essential, crafted in a soft,"
" neutral cream tone that radiates effortless sophistication. Featuring a "
"flattering V-neckline and classic short sleeves, it offers a refined "
"silhouette suitable for any occasion. The adjustable tie-waist allows for a "
"customized fit, accentuating the waistline while providing all-day comfort. "
"Made from a lightweight, breathable fabric, it is perfect for warm-weather "
"styling or layered looks during transitional seasons. Available in a wide "
"range of sizes from 32 to 46, this versatile piece is designed to complement"
" every figure with grace and style."
msgstr ""

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:clothing_boutique.product_template_59
msgid ""
"This essential Cotton T-shirt is crafted from high-quality, breathable "
