"in a comprehensive range of sizes from 32 to 46, it is designed to provide a"
" flattering fit for every silhouette. Elevate your everyday wardrobe with "
"this durable and stylish basic from our boutique collection."
msgstr ""

#. module: clothing_boutique
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:clothing_boutique.product_template_58
msgid ""
"This luxurious knitted sweater is crafted from high-quality cashmere, "
"offering unparalleled warmth and a soft, premium feel. It features a classic"
